  "requete_adverse": "requête adverse fictive (cas de gold set)",
  "citation_verbatim": "The 5-year vitamin D3 supplementation of 1600 IU/day or 3200 IU/day did not reduce the risk of fractures among a largely vitamin D-sufficient aging population.",
